WEBVTT

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.960
(SQUEAKING)

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:33.840
(WHOOSHING)

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:47.560
(ROCKET FIRING)

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.520
(ROCKET FIRING)

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.480
(HYDRAULICS WHOOSHING)

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.800
(BREATHING APPARATUS HISSING)

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:19.080
Buzz Lightyear mission log.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:22.160
All signs point to this planet
as the location of Zurg's fortress,

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:26.000
but there seems to be no sign
of intelligent life anywhere.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.560
(ELECTRONIC WHIRRING)

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.880
(ALL WHIRRING)

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.880
-(GRUNTS)
-(LASER BUZZING)

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:46.560
(SCREAMING)

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.120
(ELECTRONIC WHIRRING)

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.880
-(ELECTRONIC BEEPING)
-(GRUNTS)

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:17.760
(PANTING)

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:23.400
-(BEEPING)
-(LAUGHING EVILLY)

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:25.920
Come to me, my prey.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.480
(CONTINUES GASPING)

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:37.600
(GRUNTS)

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.560
(ELECTRONIC BUZZING)

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:01.520
(SCREAMING)

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:11.800
To infinity and beyond!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.800
(ELECTRONIC WHIRRING)

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:26.760
So, we meet again,
Buzz Lightyear, for the last time.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.200
Not today, Zurg!

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.760
-(CRIES OUT)
-(GRUNTS)

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:44.160
(LAUGHING MANIACALLY)

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:49.760
-No, no, no, no.
-Oh, you almost had him.

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:52.920
-I'm never gonna defeat Zurg!
-Sure, you will, Rex.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.480
In fact, you're a better Buzz than I am.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.120
But look at my little arms!

00:04:56.200 --> 00:05:00.320
I can't press the "fire" button
and jump at the same time!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.440
Where is it? Where is it?

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:05.720
-Woody?
-Huh? (GRUNTS)

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.960
-(CONTINUES GRUNTING)
-BOTH: Ooh.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:10.720
Hang on, cowboy!

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:17.800
-Woody, are you all right?
-(GRUNTS) Oh. Yeah.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:21.640
Yeah, I'm fine, Buzz. Okay. Here's your
list of things to do while I'm gone.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.040
Batteries need to be changed.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:25.040
Toys in the bottom of the chest
need to be rotated.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:27.480
Oh, and make sure everyone
attends Mr. Spell's seminar

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.520
on what to do
if you or a part of you is swallowed.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.280
Okay? Okay. Good. Okay.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:33.440
Woody, you haven't found
your hat yet, have you?

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.160
No! And Andy's leaving
for cowboy camp any minute,

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:37.520
and I can't find it anywhere!

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.600
Don't worry, Woody.
In just a few hours,

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:44.440
you'll be sitting around a campfire with
Andy making delicious, hot "sch'moes."

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:47.200
-They're called s'mores, Buzz.
-Right. Right. Of course.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.360
Has anyone found Woody's hat yet?

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:53.120
SERGEANT: Keep looking, men.
Dig deeper! Negatory. Still searching.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:57.560
The lawn gnome next door says it's not
in the yard, but he'll keep lookin'.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.400
(SHEEP BLEATING)

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:02.600
It's not in Molly's room.
We've looked everywhere.

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:04.360
-I found it.
-You found my hat?

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:07.640
Your hat? No.
The missus lost her earring.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:11.440
-Oh, my little sweet potato!
-Oh, you found it!

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:13.840
Oh, it's so nice

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:17.440
to have a big, strong spud
around the house.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.040
-Ooh! (GIGGLES)
-Oh, great. That's just great.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:23.240
This'll be the first year I miss cowboy
camp, all because of my stupid hat!

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.600
-Woody, look under your boot.
-Don't be silly.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:28.720
-My hat is not under my boot.
-Would you just look?

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:32.040
(GROANS) No hat.
Just the word "Andy."

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.360
Uh-huh. And the boy who wrote that

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:37.800
would take you to camp
with or without your hat.

